{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for PastelVibe', 'description': 'Primary container for PastelVibe implementation: VibeVerse is a modern, aesthetic web app where users select a color palette to generate a matching music playlist (Spotify/YouTube embed) and an aesthetic moodboard. The site features a dreamy, pastel-themed design with soft gradients, rounded cards, and smooth animations. Users can pick from pre-made or custom palettes, view generated vibes, and explore how color and music affect mood. The site is highly visual, responsive, and fun, appealing to lovers of aesthetics and unique digital experiences.', 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Color Palette Selection",\n      "description": "Users can choose from pre-made pastel palettes or create their own using color pickers.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Playlist Generation",\n      "description": "Generates and embeds a Spotify or YouTube playlist that matches the selected color palette\'s vibe.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Moodboard Generation",\n      "description": "Displays a grid of aesthetic images (moodboard) that visually match the chosen palette and vibe.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Gallery of Vibes",\n      "description": "Users can browse previously generated or demo vibes, filter by color or mood, and view palette, playlist, and moodboard snippets.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "About & Color Psychology",\n      "description": "About page explains VibeVerse, its creator, and how color/music affect mood, with fun personality profiles for each vibe.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Responsive & Animated UI",\n      "description": "Modern, responsive design with glassmorphism, rounded cards, soft gradients, smooth animations, and hover effects.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#D8B4FE",\n    "secondary": "#F9A8D4",\n    "accent": "#93C5FD"\n  },\n  "theme": "dark",\n  "layoutDescription": "The site uses a 5-page structure: Home (hero section with animated gradient background, logo, tagline, and CTA), Color Picker (palette selection with rounded cards and soft UI), Playlist & Moodboard Result (split view: playlist embed and image grid, with color psychology blurb), Gallery (grid of vibe cards with hover effects and filters), and About (info, credits, and fun vibe profiles). All pages use pastel colors, glassmorphism cards, modern typography, and smooth transitions. The layout is fully responsive and visually rich."\n}'}",
